### Get Pack
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/Api/v1/Packs/821423d3-a472-491d-9886-42c20134285a
Content-Type: application/json

### Get All Pack
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/Api/v1/Packs?$expand=Items($expand=Equipment)
Content-Type: application/json

